====================================================================
INSTRUMENT → RDGMFEQ OPERATOR MAPPINGS
====================================================================

--------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Vernier Calipers → AlignOp (SID.Interaction)
--------------------------------------------------------------------
RDG:
    AlignOp(r_main, r_vernier) =
        min_k | r_main - r_vernier + k*ε |

PED:
    Power      = sliding constraint
    Evaluation = coincidence index k
    Dynamics   = micro‑alignment process

--------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Dividers & Compasses → IsoOp (SID.Structure)
--------------------------------------------------------------------
RDG:
    IsoOp(P,Q,P',Q') : d(P,Q) = d(P',Q')

PED:
    Power      = fixed radius constraint
    Evaluation = metric equality
    Dynamics   = rotational sweep

--------------------------------------------------------------------
3. Protractor → PhaseOp (SID.Evaluation)
--------------------------------------------------------------------
RDG:
    PhaseOp(P,Q,R) = θ = angle(P,Q,R)

PED:
    Power      = geometric projection
    Evaluation = phase θ
    Dynamics   = static readout

--------------------------------------------------------------------
4. Sector → SimOp (SID.Structure + Interaction)
--------------------------------------------------------------------
RDG:
    SimOp(a,b,c,d) : a/b = c/d

PED:
    Power      = hinge angle defines similarity class
    Evaluation = transversal intercept
    Dynamics   = leg sliding

--------------------------------------------------------------------
5. Proportional Divider → LinMap (SID.Structure)
--------------------------------------------------------------------
RDG:
    LinMap(x) = λ * x

PED:
    Power      = fixed mechanical ratio λ
    Evaluation = scaled distance
    Dynamics   = rigid linkage

--------------------------------------------------------------------
6. Ellipsograph / Trammel → ConicDyn (SID.Dynamics)
--------------------------------------------------------------------
RDG:
    x(θ) = a*cos(θ)
    y(θ) = b*sin(θ)

PED:
    Power      = orthogonal slot constraints
    Evaluation = parametric state θ
    Dynamics   = continuous constrained motion

--------------------------------------------------------------------
7. Balance / Scale → MomentEq (SID.Interaction)
--------------------------------------------------------------------
RDG:
    MomentEq(m1,m2,d1,d2) : m1*d1 = m2*d2

PED:
    Power      = gravitational potential
    Evaluation = equilibrium condition
    Dynamics   = pivot settling

--------------------------------------------------------------------
8. Surveying Quadrant → ProjExtract (SID.Structure)
--------------------------------------------------------------------
RDG:
    ProjExtract(P) = dir(P)

PED:
    Power      = line‑of‑sight constraint
    Evaluation = projective angle
    Dynamics   = static alignment


